IMAPAccount posteo
Host posteo.de
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
User {{ .email | quote }}
PassCmd "gpg -dq --no-tty ~/.dotfiles/secrets/smtp-pass.gpg"
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/cert.pem

IMAPStore posteo-remote
Account posteo

MaildirStore posteo-local
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel posteo
Far :posteo-remote:
Near :posteo-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
